{"data":[{"author_id":"1273296208987959296","created_at":"2026-10-15T10:13:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110675472459960649"],"id":"2110675472459960649","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":49,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"9 月中国的社融数据，依然是新增社融↑\n\n新增人民币贷款↓\n\n贷款中，居民、企业全部下跌\n\n社融靠政府发债支撑\n\n显示出从土地财政到债务财政的转化\n\n一方面限制政府发债，一方面地方政府用城投的方式借债\n\n当然城投现在也是越来越难借到了\n\n就看什么时候发债会被迫放开额度，不放开就拖工资，苦一苦百姓","url":"https://x.com/jianjun88435910/status/2110675472459960649"},{"author_id":"2071871914533068800","created_at":"2026-10-15T14:30:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110740001327861866"],"id":"2110740001327861866","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":252,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"中国9月新增社融3.55万亿元，居民端仍弱","url":"https://x.com/swordBluesy/status/2110740001327861866"},{"author_id":"1871754217498836992","created_at":"2026-10-14T22:44:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110502098546946543"],"id":"2110502098546946543","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":9,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"央行最新公布2026年前三季度金融数据：9月末社融存量达468.17万亿元（同比增长7.1%），前三季度社融累计增量27.46万亿元，人民币贷款增加11.52万亿元。信贷总量平稳扩张的同时，债券与股票等直接融资占比明显提速，折射出国内资金流向与融资结构的深层调整","url":"https://x.com/red192393/status/2110502098546946543"},{"author_id":"2058818302311600128","created_at":"2026-10-15T11:03:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110687881882722379"],"id":"2110687881882722379","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":21,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"9月新增社融约3.55万亿元，单看总量还可以。但拉长到前三季度，对实体经济发放的人民币贷款同比少增约3.04万亿元，企业债券净融资则同比多增约1.18万亿元。\n所以社融这道题，不能只看“加了多少”，还要看钱通过什么渠道出去、实体愿不愿意借。","url":"https://x.com/WilliamZyovo/status/2110687881882722379"},{"author_id":"73251735","created_at":"2026-10-15T11:03:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110687881824202906"],"id":"2110687881824202906","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"9月新增社融约3.55万亿元，单看总量还可以。但拉长到前三季度，对实体经济发放的人民币贷款同比少增约3.04万亿元，企业债券净融资则同比多增约1.18万亿元。\n所以社融这道题，不能只看“加了多少”，还要看钱通过什么渠道出去、实体愿不愿意借。","url":"https://x.com/Blympie/status/2110687881824202906"},{"author_id":"2869390354","created_at":"2026-10-14T23:24:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110512088758272238"],"id":"2110512088758272238","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":326,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"中国 9 月社融新增 3.55 万亿元，人民币贷款新增 1.08 万亿，环比双双大幅回升，M2 同比增加 7.2%\n\n中国 9 月社融新增 3.55 万亿元，人民币贷款新增 1.08 万亿，环比双双大幅回升，M2 同比增","url":"https://x.com/jhdxhl/status/2110512088758272238"},{"author_id":"1896761185938345984","created_at":"2026-10-15T00:04:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110522162981548407"],"id":"2110522162981548407","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":20,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"🎊社融数据很漂亮，企业借钱积极忙。\n唯独居民躺平观望，不想借钱加杠杆。\n企业：我要搞生产；居民：我先苟住再说。","url":"https://x.com/haotianche21370/status/2110522162981548407"},{"author_id":"1986369265130430464","created_at":"2026-10-15T01:41:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110546599063777454"],"id":"2110546599063777454","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":8,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"信用端在收缩\n\n社融存量同比 7.1%、M1 3.2%（央行 10/14 发布）。\n融资余额指数 102.6 创年内新低，\n两融较 6 月高点回落近 4700 亿，\n权益基金周发行仅 12 亿。\n\n信心在哪？","url":"https://x.com/wang_yi59336/status/2110546599063777454"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110532776202014720"]},"author_id":"1692431366494064640","created_at":"2026-10-15T00:46:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110532803427209638"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/vJ6lvwnZhK","end":73,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/LJanemy52737/status/2110532803427209638/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110532776202014720","start":50,"url":"https://t.co/vJ6lvwnZhK"}]},"id":"2110532803427209638","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":21,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"央行公布了前三季度金融数据，上了腾讯的热搜。报告很长，术语很多，普通人不用啃全文，盯住三个数就行。 https://t.co/vJ6lvwnZhK","url":"https://x.com/LJanemy52737/status/2110532803427209638"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110714505038905345"]},"author_id":"1210756416652242944","created_at":"2026-10-15T19:48:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110820001599128024"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/mQb1UZP3ix","end":135,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/fingraph66/status/2110820001599128024/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110714505038905345","start":112,"url":"https://t.co/mQb1UZP3ix"}]},"id":"2110820001599128024","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":270,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"2026年9月，社会融资规模存量同比增长7.1%，M2同比增长7.2%，社融增速慢于M2增速0.1个百分点，货币投放尚未充分转化为实体信用，但剪刀差较上月收紧0.2个百分点。\n来源：边际Lab x FinGraph财经图集 https://t.co/mQb1UZP3ix","url":"https://x.com/fingraph66/status/2110820001599128024"},{"author_id":"1705676935949594624","created_at":"2026-10-15T04:52:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110594729637458016"],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"end":114,"start":111,"tag":"财经"},{"end":120,"start":115,"tag":"货币政策"}]},"id":"2110594729637458016","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":35,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"央行前三季度金融数据出炉：9月末M2同比7.2%、社融存量同比7.1%，债股融资占比49.48%、反超贷款约7个百分点。钱换道了——企业借钱不再只走银行贷款这根水管，紧盯信贷单指标会看走眼；券商承销和直接融资端才是真动了。#财经 #货币政策","url":"https://x.com/caixunexpress/status/2110594729637458016"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110612907952386048","3_2110612908925468672"]},"author_id":"1486571626661437440","created_at":"2026-10-15T06:10:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110614212523553037"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/HdAxNndG50","end":127,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Yelvlv930/status/2110614212523553037/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110612907952386048","start":104,"url":"https://t.co/HdAxNndG50"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/HdAxNndG50","end":127,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Yelvlv930/status/2110614212523553037/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110612908925468672","start":104,"url":"https://t.co/HdAxNndG50"}]},"id":"2110614212523553037","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":5112,"like_count":29,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":6},"text":"9月金融数据：贷款增速4.8%，居民新增贷款为零\n\n9月末，人民币贷款余额同比增长4.8%，8月是4.9%。有记录以来最低（路透）。\n\n前三季度，人民币贷款增加11.52万亿元，去年同期是14.75万亿元。 https://t.co/HdAxNndG50","url":"https://x.com/Yelvlv930/status/2110614212523553037"},{"author_id":"1990030666453655552","created_at":"2026-10-15T01:04:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110537288413516231"],"id":"2110537288413516231","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":508,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"央行数据曝光+美联储突发利空！今天A股大盘将面临3741点生死战！ 📊⚠️\n\n昨天的两市暴跌（超4300只个股下跌，中位数-1.93%）只是前戏，昨晚夜间迎来的三大利空组合拳，才是决定今天甚至短期走势的关键：\n🔍 核心利空拆解：\n利空一：社融数据揭示“融资市”本质。","url":"https://x.com/N2qMo8KlRY604/status/2110537288413516231"},{"author_id":"1539258295957221376","created_at":"2026-10-16T00:35:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110892408129159236"],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"end":140,"start":135,"tag":"中国经济"},{"end":146,"start":141,"tag":"中国房价"}]},"id":"2110892408129159236","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"说个暴论\n为什么中国经济一直硬不起来\n\n其实是房价跌得太慢了\n俗话说利空出尽是利好\n\n房价跌的越慢\n预期和需求反转来得越晚\n人们迟迟等不到反转点，等不到“跌得差不多了”的信号\n就会持续修复资产负债表，持续去杠杆，存款率就持续升高，社融就持续降低\n\n经济就会一直活人微死\n#中国经济 #中国房价","url":"https://x.com/OutsiderVincent/status/2110892408129159236"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111090946968616960","3_2111090947027271680","3_2111090946997952512"]},"author_id":"1691439809028632576","created_at":"2026-10-16T13:44:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111090993617649889"],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"end":10,"start":0,"tag":"9月金融数据继续弱"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/uci7Kqc6tM","end":188,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/mikeyequzi/status/2111090993617649889/photo/1","media_key":"3_2111090946968616960","start":165,"url":"https://t.co/uci7Kqc6tM"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/uci7Kqc6tM","end":188,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/mikeyequzi/status/2111090993617649889/photo/1","media_key":"3_2111090947027271680","start":165,"url":"https://t.co/uci7Kqc6tM"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/uci7Kqc6tM","end":188,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/mikeyequzi/status/2111090993617649889/photo/1","media_key":"3_2111090946997952512","start":165,"url":"https://t.co/uci7Kqc6tM"},{"display_url":"x.com/mikeyequzi/sta…","end":212,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/mikeyequzi/status/2110382299909148765","start":189,"url":"https://t.co/ahssRJhXhF"}]},"id":"2111090993617649889","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":36,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"#9月金融数据继续弱 9月新增贷款大月1.08万亿同比少增2100亿上月800亿；社融3.55万亿同比多增192亿政府债发行提速净融资1.53万亿增速较8月7.2%继续回落至7.1%；M2M1双回落其中MI回落0.9个百分点全社会信用继续收缩-内需继续弱化。图1揭示企业个人贷款进入长期去杠杆进程：市场主体去债务-信贷20年起。 https://t.co/uci7Kqc6tM https://t.co/ahssRJhXhF","url":"https://x.com/mikeyequzi/status/2111090993617649889"},{"author_id":"137332930","created_at":"2026-10-15T01:50:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110548923505164701"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/syu77996/statu…","end":136,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/syu77996/status/2110328710830395849","start":113,"url":"https://t.co/FjqqWa9XT4"}]},"id":"2110548923505164701","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":11654,"like_count":15,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"美银的看法也是我的看法，对外人民币升值对冲美元加息，对内双降，继续降准降息：\n\n虽然强劲的出口表现降低了刺激国内需求的紧迫性，但如果三季度3个月的数据都“差”，那么政府可能会再推出一系列措施，以更明确地表明政策正在发生转变。 https://t.co/FjqqWa9XT4","url":"https://x.com/cnfinancewatch/status/2110548923505164701"},{"author_id":"2103043701245374464","created_at":"2026-10-14T23:58:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110520644177924205"],"id":"2110520644177924205","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":206,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"2026年10月15日#早报，星期四，农历九月初六\n\n1. 央行：9月末社融存量为468.17万亿元，同比增长7.1%，广义货币(M2)余额359.63万亿元人民币，同比增长7.2%，狭义货币(M1)余额116.76万亿元，同比增长3.2%，流通中货币(M0)余额15.02万亿元，同比增长10.6%。\n\n2.","url":"https://x.com/YapToCreate/status/2110520644177924205"},{"author_id":"1972218614473543685","created_at":"2026-10-16T04:23:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110949743048503354"],"id":"2110949743048503354","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"【1016早报】\n一、隔夜概况\n①道指涨1.1%，纳指涨0.1%，标普500涨0.3%，费城半导体跌0.9%，风险偏好边际修复，但半导体设备仍弱\n②美国9月PPI同比6.3%，高于预期；10年期美债收益率5.06%，较10月7日的阶段高点5.36%明显回落\n③商品方面，黄金涨2%，白银涨3%\n\n二、重点关注\n3️⃣流动性","url":"https://x.com/hdl48/status/2110949743048503354"},{"author_id":"2022596817238790148","created_at":"2026-10-15T11:50:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110699941928603861"],"id":"2110699941928603861","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":39,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"【债券市场观察｜通胀与信用风险升温，美债和银行债券承压】\n\n🌍 海外宏观：美联储降息预期再受考验\n▪️ 美联储褐皮书显示，高油价冲击多个辖区，企业预计物价将进一步上涨。\n▪️ 鲍曼认为暂时无需急于调整利率；戴利称加息可能有必要，但并非迫在眉睫；古尔斯比则强调需要更多通胀数据。\n▪️","url":"https://x.com/Lurry12334/status/2110699941928603861"},{"author_id":"1972218614473543685","created_at":"2026-10-15T02:08:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110553318330380362"],"id":"2110553318330380362","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"宏观：\n1.美国核心物价涨幅高于预期。交易员加大对10月美联储加息押注，并预计到2027年底还将加息三次。\n2.卖方：9月金融数据延续弱势，信贷投放同比继续少增，社融余额同比继续下行，金融数据反映私人部门融资需求不足，经济复苏仍需更多政策支持。","url":"https://x.com/hdl48/status/2110553318330380362"},{"author_id":"1886674236561100800","created_at":"2026-10-15T01:58:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110550877039947923","2110550955301507442"],"id":"2110550877039947923","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"每日热点简报｜10/15 早\n\n先说结论：CPI 超预期之后 AI 股遭抛售，纳指跌 1.9%，是 7 月以来最差的一天；美债收益率冲高后回落，加密和港股跟着走弱；传音上市首日破发。\n\n加密\n\nBTC 约 81,724 美元，24h 跌约 1.7%；ETH 约 2,418 美元，跌约 3.3%；BTC 市占约 59.3%（截至北京 09:40，CoinGecko）。","url":"https://x.com/Duetopid/status/2110550877039947923"},{"author_id":"1886674236561100800","created_at":"2026-10-15T01:58:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110550877039947923","2110550955301507442"],"id":"2110550955301507442","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":251,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"每日热点简报｜10/15 早\n\nCPI 超预期之后 AI 股遭抛售，纳指跌 1.9%，是 7 月以来最差的一天；美债收益率冲高后回落，加密和港股跟着走弱；传音上市首日破发。\n\n加密\n\nBTC 约 81,724 美元，24h 跌约 1.7%；ETH 约 2,418 美元，跌约 3.3%；BTC 市占约 59.3%（截至北京 09:40，CoinGecko）。\nBTC 现货","url":"https://x.com/Duetopid/status/2110550955301507442"},{"author_id":"2009430739096584192","created_at":"2026-10-15T22:27:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110860082510778792"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"M2 growth slowed to an 18-month low of 7.2% and yuan loan growth hit a record-low 4.8%. The 10-year government bond yield fell to 1.65% anyway, a day after factory-gate inflation reached 5.0%.","display_url":"macrosoup.com/chinas-bond-ma…","end":270,"expanded_url":"https://macrosoup.com/chinas-bond-market-is-betting-on-weak-credit-not-5-factory-inflation/","images":[{"height":1200,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2110739289776791552/FfrK5Ubt?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1200},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2110739289776791552/FfrK5Ubt?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":247,"status":200,"title":"🇨🇳 China's bond market is betting on weak credit, not 5% factory inflation","unwound_url":"https://macrosoup.com/chinas-bond-market-is-betting-on-weak-credit-not-5-factory-infla